{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>護膚成分表密密麻麻，想看懂配方並不容易。FormuLens 讓你拍照掃描護膚、彩妝、護髮及防曬產品的成分清單，以淺白文字解讀每種成分的作用，並比較產品或檢查日常護理組合是否配合。此 App 適合關注成分的護膚愛好者與敏感肌人士，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-148.webp\">\n<h2>掃描成分表讀懂配方</h2>\n<p>拍照或匯入相片即可掃描潔面、精華、防曬、彩妝及護髮標籤，標籤過長可分多張相片掃描再合併。它會以淺白文字解釋每種成分的角色，並按產品類型標示關鍵與少見成分。你可並排比較同類產品，或檢查護理次序與成分衝突。分析全程在裝置上完成，無需帳號。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-158-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-159-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-160-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-161-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-162-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-163-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：FormuLens: Ingredient Analyzer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.322518+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":327,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T13:00:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:56:13.994189+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:17.002102+00:00","content_hash":"30e3efb92cf373c7bdfcb79151515b65c48a01da72b10bf6f5b11abd97727e93","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}